Saved supplier reports now lead with risk, confidence and coverage charts, followed by a horizontal risk comparison and direct section navigation. Findings, actions, uncertainties and limitations show at most five items per page; remaining items are accessible through paging. Original evidence is expandable and finding links open its matching source.

Insufficient information remains visibly unknown and suppresses an overall numeric score. This release includes only report presentation files based on the current deployed main revision; pending extraction/backend changes are excluded.

Validation: 112 frontend tests and TypeScript passed against the deployment baseline. The matching UI was checked in the browser for scored/insufficient reports, paging, source navigation and responsive layout. Web and extension production builds passed locally; the client artifact scan found no configured server credentials. GitHub CI is completing deployable image and browser checks before merge.
